# No EOL normalization for the verification script: its SHA-256 is quoted as
# evidence in docs/planning/PHASE0.md and must stay identical on every platform.
* text=auto
scripts/verify_phase0.py -text
# Vendored third-party bundle whose bytes must stay byte-identical to the
# SRI hash locked in app/static/index.html (e2e/vendor/SOURCE.md). Without
# this, `* text=auto` normalizes its few embedded CRLF/LF sequences on
# checkout (Windows: LF->CRLF), silently changing the SHA-384 the browser
# computes and breaking every E2E sign-in with no diff ever showing in
# `git status` -- diagnosed 2026-09-20.
e2e/vendor/supabase.min.js -text
# Matplotlib SVG path data legitimately ends some coordinate lines with spaces.
*.svg whitespace=-blank-at-eol
